    "partNumber": 4,
    "formContent": "<div class=\"ielts-form-container\"><div class=\"form-section\"><div class=\"form-title\" style=\"text-align:center;font-weight:700;font-size:1.3em;margin-bottom:12px;\">ETHNOGRAPHY IN BUSINESS</div><p>Ethnography: research which explores human cultures</p><p style=\"margin-top:8px;\">It can be used in business:</p><p style=\"padding-left:18px;\">&bull;&nbsp; to investigate customer needs and <strong>31</strong> <input type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" class=\"gap-input\" data-q=\"31\" style=\"width:150px;text-align:center;\"></p><p style=\"padding-left:18px;\">&bull;&nbsp; to help companies develop new designs</p><p style=\"font-weight:700;margin-top:12px;\">Examples of ethnographic research in business</p><p style=\"font-weight:700;margin-top:8px;\">Kitchen equipment</p><p style=\"padding-left:18px;\">&bull;&nbsp; Researchers found that cooks could not easily see the <strong>32</strong> <input type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" class=\"gap-input\" data-q=\"32\" style=\"width:150px;text-align:center;\"> in measuring cups.</p><p style=\"font-weight:700;margin-top:8px;\">Cell phones</p><p style=\"padding-left:18px;\">&bull;&nbsp; In Uganda, customers paid to use the cell phones of entrepreneurs.</p><p style=\"padding-left:18px;\">&bull;&nbsp; These customers wanted to check the <strong>33</strong> <input type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" class=\"gap-input\" data-q=\"33\" style=\"width:150px;text-align:center;\"> used.</p><p style=\"font-weight:700;margin-top:8px;\">Computer companies</p><p style=\"padding-left:18px;\">&bull;&nbsp; There was a need to develop <strong>34</strong> <input type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" class=\"gap-input\" data-q=\"34\" style=\"width:150px;text-align:center;\"> to improve communication between system administrators and colleagues.</p><p style=\"font-weight:700;margin-top:8px;\">Hospitals</p><p style=\"padding-left:18px;\">&bull;&nbsp; Nurses needed to access information about <strong>35</strong> <input type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" class=\"gap-input\" data-q=\"35\" style=\"width:150px;text-align:center;\"> in different parts of the hospital.</p><p style=\"font-weight:700;margin-top:8px;\">Airlines</p><p style=\"padding-left:18px;\">&bull;&nbsp; Respondents recorded information about their <strong>36</strong> <input type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" class=\"gap-input\" data-q=\"36\" style=\"width:150px;text-align:center;\"> while travelling.</p><p style=\"font-weight:700;margin-top:12px;\">Principles of ethnographic research in business</p><p style=\"padding-left:18px;\">&bull;&nbsp; The researcher does not start off with a hypothesis.</p><p style=\"padding-left:18px;\">&bull;&nbsp; Participants may be selected by criteria such as age, <strong>37</strong> <input type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" class=\"gap-input\" data-q=\"37\" style=\"width:150px;text-align:center;\"> or product used.</p><p style=\"padding-left:18px;\">&bull;&nbsp; The participants must feel <strong>38</strong> <input type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" class=\"gap-input\" data-q=\"38\" style=\"width:150px;text-align:center;\"> about taking part in the research.</p><p style=\"padding-left:18px;\">&bull;&nbsp; There is usually direct <strong>39</strong> <input type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" class=\"gap-input\" data-q=\"39\" style=\"width:150px;text-align:center;\"> of the participants.</p><p style=\"padding-left:18px;\">&bull;&nbsp; The interview is guided by the participant.</p><p style=\"padding-left:18px;\">&bull;&nbsp; A lot of time is needed for the <strong>40</strong> <input type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" class=\"gap-input\" data-q=\"40\" style=\"width:150px;text-align:center;\"> of the data.</p><p style=\"padding-left:18px;\">&bull;&nbsp; Researchers look for a meaningful pattern in the data.</p></div></div>",
